    archive.mspa.story['004370'].content = '|DIALOGLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #626262">癌遗传学家 carcinoGeneticist [CG]</span> 开始骚扰 <span style="color: #a1a100">双生审判末日 twinArmageddons [TA]</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #626262">CG: 老兄你还好吗。</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #626262">CG: 嘿</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #626262">CG: 喔天啊</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #626262">CG: 我做了什么。</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #626262">CG: SOLLUX？ SOLLUX？</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #626262">CG: 拜託告诉我那些只是蜂蜜。</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #626262">CG: 拜託只是蜂蜜拜託只是蜂蜜拜託只是蜂蜜</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #626262">CG: 哈哈，够了，装死时间过了喔！</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #626262">CG: 天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊天啊</span>'
