    archive.mspa.story['004718'].content = '|DIALOGLOG|<br/><br/>-- 极其善变 terminallyCapricious <span style="color: #2b0057;">[TC]</span> 开始骚扰 科技转盘神 turntechGodhead <span style="color: #e00707;">[TG]</span> --<br /><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>好</b>啦<b>我</b>操<b>他</b>妈<b>的</b>粉<b>红</b>星<b>星</b>小<b>猴</b>子</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>你</b>准<b>备</b>好</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>把</b>你<b>没</b>有<b>的</b>角</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>像</b>个<b>违</b>禁<b>叭</b>噗<b>品</b>一<b>样</b>拿<b>去</b>充<b>公</b>吧</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>就</b>像<b>它</b>本<b>身</b>是<b>个</b>笑<b>话</b>一<b>样</b>违<b>法</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 然<b>后</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 把<b>它</b>交<b>还</b>给<b>你</b>?</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 啥</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>哈</b>哈<b>,</b>看<b>哪</b>兄<b>弟</b>,<b>这</b>就<b>是</b>我<b>的</b>把<b>戏</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 我<b>把</b>角<b>传</b>给<b>你</b>,<b>操</b>他<b>吗</b>的<b>说</b>起<b>来</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 看<b>,</b>就<b>像</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 一<b>种</b>tRoLl<b>的</b>隐<b>喻</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 你<b>亲</b>手<b>得</b>到<b>了</b>所<b>有</b>的<b>角</b>,<b>如</b>果<b>你</b>就<b>结</b>构<b>上</b>来<b>看</b>,<b>我</b>们<b>就</b>差<b>不</b>多<b>是</b>那<b>样</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 那<b>么</b>做<b>表</b>示<b>你</b>已<b>经</b>操<b>他</b>妈<b>的</b>被<b>冒</b>犯<b>啦</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 被TrOlL了<b>一</b>番</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>但</b>是<b>兄</b>弟<b>一</b>旦<b>我</b>对<b>你</b>发<b>出</b>了<b>那</b>噪<b>音</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 我<b>就</b>像<b>是</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 整<b>个</b>双<b>倍</b>的<b>隐</b>喻</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>跨</b>越<b>苍</b>穹<b>之</b>地<b>一</b>般 :o)</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>因</b>为<b>我</b>的<b>头</b>角<b>已</b>经<b>完</b>全<b>被</b>这<b>些</b>喇<b>叭</b>角<b>给</b>替<b>换</b>掉<b>啦</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 就<b>像</b>小<b>丑</b>干<b>的</b>一<b>样</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 然<b>后</b>等<b>到</b>我<b>要</b>操<b>他</b>妈<b>的</b>来<b>邀</b>请<b>你</b>来<b>捏</b>它<b>一</b>下<b>的</b>时<b>候</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 如<b>果</b>你<b>奇</b>蹟<b>般</b>的<b>没</b>有<b>被</b>这<b>丑</b>角<b>吓</b>到<b>挫</b>屎<b>的</b>话<b>我</b>可<b>是</b>会<b>非</b>常<b>沮</b>丧<b>的</b>呆<b>愣</b>在<b>那</b>喔</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>我</b>们<b>就</b>是<b>要</b>这<b>么</b>操<b>他</b>妈<b>的</b>玩<b>这</b>个<b>游</b>戏</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 叭<b>噗</b>叭<b>噗</b> &gt;:o)</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 喔老天哪没错</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 你就是那个最棒的troll</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 我想起来了</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 哇<b>,</b>我<b>是</b>吗<b>?</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 对呀</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 我的意思是</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 用一种最讽刺又最可笑的方式来说</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 但是其实这说都不用说</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 干<b>,</b>我<b>一</b>定<b>有</b>办<b>法</b>能<b>做</b>得<b>更</b>好<b>的</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 这对我来说是几个月前的事了</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 你搞了你的诡异小丑狂热东西</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 然后跑来对我发牢骚和呻吟什么毁了你的信仰还是啥鸟的狗屎烂蛋</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 我猜像是某种信仰危机吧我不知道</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 然后</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 我猜你大概是挺过来了</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 然后我们一起来上了一段悖论宇宙中有史以来最讚的rap</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 记得吗</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 噢<b>干</b>他<b>老</b>妈<b>的</b>不<b>记</b>得 :o(</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>如</b>果<b>我</b>有<b>一</b>段<b>像</b>那<b>样</b>的<b>贱</b>婊<b>子</b>时<b>光</b>我<b>一</b>定<b>会</b>记<b>得</b>的</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>虽</b>然<b>我</b>的<b>脑</b>袋<b>现</b>在<b>不</b>是<b>那</b>么<b>清</b>楚<b>,</b>距<b>离</b>我<b>上</b>次<b>享</b>受<b>一</b>份<b>超</b>讚<b>的</b>派<b>已</b>经<b>像</b>几<b>世</b>纪<b>那</b>么<b>久</b>了</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 可能是时间之类的狗屎</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 你可能还没有过那段对话</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>狗</b>娘<b>的</b>,<b>我</b>甚<b>至</b>不<b>知</b>道<b>我</b>有<b>没</b>有<b>认</b>真<b>考</b>虑<b>过</b>玩<b>那</b>种<b>玩</b>意<b>儿</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 我<b>不</b>瞭<b>时</b>间</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>我</b>不<b>是</b>干<b>时</b>间<b>的</b>傢<b>伙</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 我<b>是</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>操</b>他<b>妈</b>的</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>什</b>么<b>鸟</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 之<b>诗</b>人</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>干</b>我<b>忘</b>了 :o(</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 你记不记得你看过任何影片</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 地球的</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 应该是我寄过去的</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: <b>不</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 老兄我跟你说</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 你一定要试试这个</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 相信我这会把你的灵魂昇华到终结 一切都会有合理解释</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 你最终会搞懂你到底是谁还有你为什么要崇拜这些可笑的小丑狗屎</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 喔<b>,</b>老<b>兄</b></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: 这<b>听</b>起<b>来</b>讚<b>透</b>了<b>,</b>我<b>看</b>不<b>出</b>来<b>有</b>什<b>么</b>好<b>拒</b>绝<b>这</b>种<b>操</b>蛋<b>狗</b>屎<b>的</b>好<b>机</b>会</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 你也会搞懂还有到底是什么莫名其妙的原因你的星球上会有faygo</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 老实说算了忘了它吧它其实没有解释到</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 那完全他妈的没道理</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 但像是</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 你在寻找的东西</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 你的闇阎滑稽救世主或是干他妈的什么</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 你喜乐的弥赛亚</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 阿哈哈哈哈你看我边打这些边笑掉我的屁股</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 总之它们就在这儿兄弟</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG: 去看看</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">TG:<a href="/archive/external/miracles.mp4" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://tinyurl.com/<b>操</b>他<b>妈</b>的<b>奇</b>蹟</a></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #2b0057;">TC: :oO</span>'
