    archive.mspa.story['007616'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007616'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">JAKE！</span></span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow { 0%  {color: #fff6d1;} 50% {color: #f0d1ff;} 100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow { 0%  {color: #fff6d1;} 50% {color: #f0d1ff;} 100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007617'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007617'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">JAAAAAAAAAAAKE！</span></span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007618'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007618'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">JAKE JAKE JAKE JAKE JAKE JAKE JAKE JAKE JAKE JAKE JAKE！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: Jane？</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: 是你吗？ ？</span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007619'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007619'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">嘿JAKE！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">JAKE是我JANE哈哈！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">嘿JAKE你猜怎么了！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我爱你！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">这难道不赞吗？ ？ ？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: 额Jane...</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: 你发生了什么事？</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我一直爱着你！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">但我太害怕了不敢说！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">但现在我不怕了！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">喔耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: 什么？</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: 真的吗？ ？</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">是啊！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我之前太伤心了！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">但现在我开心了！ ！ ！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">哇吼吼吼吼吼吼吼吼吼吼吼！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">你也爱我对吧JAKE？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">嘿JAKE！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">来接吻吧！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: Jane</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: 我...</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: 呃</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">让我们来接一大堆吻然后结婚！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">然后生小孩！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">你想和我生小孩对吧JAKE！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: Jane你吓到我了！</span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007620'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007620'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">什么！啊哈哈哈！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">根本没有必要害怕你个小傻瓜！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">因为我超开心而且我爱你！你看不出来吗？ ？ ？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: 不Jane你真的快把我吓挫屎了！</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: 你看起来并不好...</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: 你确定你还好吗？</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我还好吗？ ？ ？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">JAKE！我比还好更好！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我感觉棒极了！</span></span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007621'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007621'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我深刻地感觉我充满活力！</span></span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007622'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007622'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我深刻地感觉我好...</span></span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007623'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007623'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><div class="animation07423"><!--白种人！-->桃色！</div><span><img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/PEACHY.gif" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/JAKENOOOOOO.gif" border="0" /></span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007624'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007624'].content = '<style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007625'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007625'].content = '<style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007626'].title = '[S] ==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007626'].content = '<style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007627'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007627'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶耶！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">JANE！嘿JANE！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">什么事啊JAKE？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">JANE握住我的手和我一起飞！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">没问题JAKE！JAKE我们要去哪！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">当然是去冒险呀！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">当然了！！！！！！！！！！！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">噢JANE！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">嗨JAKE？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我在思考你说的话！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">关于你爱我并且想和我结婚？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">是的！怎么了！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我们来做吧！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我们来和彼此恋爱！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">你真的想？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">当然！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我们亲嘴之类的那种事？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">毫无疑问！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">可以的话我现在就想在这里结婚！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">噢当然可以，我绝对喜爱和你结婚然后接好多吻的！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我相信你还提到了关于小孩的事？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">是的！小孩！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我认为你是对的！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我们应该一起生好多小孩JANE！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">多少个小孩JAKE？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">噢我不知道。或许...</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">无数个？？？？？？？？？？？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">对！！！！！！！！！！！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">这将涉及一起发生性关係！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我期待着！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我们应该尽快为此准备！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">但要等到我们的冒险后！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">你要一起来吗ERISOL先生？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #50f520;">ERISOLSPRITE: 操他妈的不不.</span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007628'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007628'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">太棒了你要来！快上来伙计！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #50f520;">ERISOLSPRITE: 操你妈, 操我的棱森, 操他妈的一切, 操操操.</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #00d5f2;">JANE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #1f9400;">JAKE: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！</span></span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
