    archive.mspa.story['007652'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我唯一沉醉的东西</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">就是不再逃跑勇敢面对我的问题的幸福感</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">以及还有</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">也许一点点点点点点酒精</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">但就这些了!!!!!! 嗝!!!!!</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 解决所有个人问题？</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 是啦。你们看起来像是状态很好。</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">太对惹</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">你应该试试</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 试什么？</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">解决你的问题题</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">这是窝现在说问题的方式</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 滚。我没什么问题。</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">看我来师范</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">DIRK泥造吗</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我对你有炒鸡狂热的爱意？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 知道。</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">哦天啊啊啊倾诉出这份敢情真是太帮了！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我们应该立刻结婚DORK你想和窝结婚吗？</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 噢。不？</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">但是窝们都要结婚了每个人都在结婚</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">JANEJAKE我是彼此的未婚夫妻了</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">更不要说在那过程中会有小孩;)</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">(暗示着做爱爱爱！)</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: Roxy，即使不经大脑地说出什么胡乱告白真的可以「解决个人问题」，这件事从来就不是个秘密。</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 我一直都知道你喜欢我。你他妈几乎每天都在向我表白。</span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
