    archive.mspa.story['007653'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">好吧没错!</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">对得不能再对</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">但我还没说过让我们来结婚&amp;&amp;生小孩对吧?</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 不，实际上你也如此提议过。很多次。</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">喔</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我说过?</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">FFFFFFFFFFF</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">好吧</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">这一次</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我带来了...........</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">一个结婚戒指!!!!!!!!!!</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">过来STRIDE</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">把这鬼玩意戴上</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 不！</span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007654'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007654'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">来嘛DRIK!</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">戴上它</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">你就能帮我解决一个我的个人问题!</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 住手。</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">和一个你的!</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">你不想解决你的蠢烦恼吗</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 这不会解决任何问题，你们这群傻逼!</span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007655'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007655'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">不DIRT你没看到吗？我们现在超开心!</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">再见艰难的交互式个人烦恼再也不见!</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 你并不开心！你是发疯了！而且像这样变得糖里糖气把几个月的冷静与节制扔进厕所冲走究竟要怎样帮你解决任何问题？ ？ ？</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">因为嗯</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">嗯</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">别改变话题STRIDERK</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">你不得不在我死的时候亲了我</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">这不公平！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">帮我解决我的这个问题</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">我没有任何关于我们甜蜜亲吻的回忆;D</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 不可能！</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">DIRCH</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">戴上它</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">BRINK MAKEOUTS</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 离我远点！</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 我有剑！ ！ ！</span> <br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007656'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007656'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">去你的盪漫剑...........</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">和我结婚生小孩!!!!!!!!!!!</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 我会用它的，我发誓！</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 它很锋利！</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 而且它很厉害！</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 而且...</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 它是把剑！ ！ ！</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: <span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">闭嘴来和你未来的妻子亲热!</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 我太酷了做不到这件事！ ！ ！ ！ ！</span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007657'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007657'].content = '|SPRITELOG|<br/><br/><span class="arquius" id="arquius"><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/arquius_shades.png" border="0" /> %兄弟%先生，请听我一言</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/arquius_shades.png" border="0" /> 我认为你应该做出尝试</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/arquius_shades.png" border="0" /> 这建议不止来自你的神秘导航灵，也不止来自另一个%形态的你自己，而是来自一个有着<span class="glitch">贼他妈</span>壮观身体的伙计</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/arquius_shades.png" border="0" /> 我们都认为你在一般情况下不可能感到开%心</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/arquius_shades.png" border="0" /> 你实在没有正确的思考煲去承担那种情感</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/arquius_shades.png" border="0" /> 看看我。我%需要和一位%喜欢马的爱出汗的傢伙融合才能感到开%心</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/arquius_shades.png" border="0" /> 天啊<span class="glitch">去他的</span>马啊Dirk</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/arquius_shades.png" border="0" /> 我收缩肌肉时一直%想着它们，那让我不禁露出微%笑</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img src="http://www.mspaintadventures.com/storyfiles/hs2/scraps/arquius_shades.png" border="0" /> 看来你也%需要%相似的极端手段</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 喔随便吧。</span><br/><br/></span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
    archive.mspa.story['007658'].title = '==>'
    archive.mspa.story['007658'].content = '|TRKSTRLOG|<br/><br/><span style="color: #ffbaf2;">ROXY: 唔嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯!</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #ffcc00;">DIRK: 唔嗯嗯嗯嗯<span style="-webkit-animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite; animation: trickster-glow 0.25s linear infinite;">嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯！</span></span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img id="shades"/> 那边的。戴着雨伞的%小随从</span><br/><br/><span style="color: #e00707;">ARQUIUSPRITE: <img id="shades"/> 快拿个毛巾给我</span><br/><br/><!-- LOG END --><br/><br/></div> </div><style>@-webkit-keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}@keyframes trickster-glow {0%  {color: #fff6d1;}50% {color: #f0d1ff;}100% {color: #d1ffe3;}}</style>'
